\section*{The generalized Mukai pseudoindex assertion}

\subsection{OpenAI's claim}
For a smooth complex Fano $n$-fold, the generalized Mukai bound $\rho(\iota-1)\le n$ is claimed, with equality exactly for the corresponding product of projective spaces. The cited manuscript argues for that result; its relation to this problem is specified below.

\subsection{Outline of the argument}
Manuscript 1 (family 063, 2026-09-24): A weighted-projective evaluation construction gives positive lower bounds for point descendants of free rational curves. Basis-invariant alternating traces detect independent curve degrees in quantum correspondences; minimal proper covering families enter in the equality case and identify the projective-space factors.

\subsection{Scope relative to this problem}
